        "DescriptionsMultilanguage": [
          {
            "en": "All zombies gain +30% movement speed, +30% attack damage, +30% health, +60% armor durability, and -30% dynamic point requirement",
            "zh": "所有僵尸的移动速度，攻击力和生命值+30%，防具耐久度+60%，动态点数需求-30%"
          },
          {
            "en": "All King and Wizard Zombies have faster ability cooldown, with some replaced by their Veteran variants",
            "zh": "所有国王和法师的释放技能速度提升且有部分被替换为它们的精英版本"
          },
          {
            "en": "All Veteran Zombies gain +50% attack damage, +50% health, and have further improved ability cooldown",
            "zh": "所有精英僵尸的攻击力和生命值+50%，释放技能速度进一步提升"
          },
          {
            "en": "Some waves and dynamic spawning are modified",
            "zh": "部分波次和动态出怪有所不同"
          },
          {
            "en": "All special gravestones are replaced with normal gravestones with increased quantity, and lawn mowers and plant food are disabled",
            "zh": "所有特殊墓碑替换为普通墓碑且数量增加，禁用割草机和叶绿素"
